      "id": "clm:f843e16b7dac593bf62150bf8c9ae8c35e0c6c85ebfb0efaf1fae853041c7840",
      "text": "In the cited pinned implementation, getPreviewForStage aborts the controller already queued for its stage index, creates a replacement AbortController, and stores it before awaiting raceWithAbort over Promise.all([getPipeline(), getPreviewOptions()]). The abort signal can therefore reject this wait while either input is unresolved. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.ts",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-utils/src/cancellable-promise.ts",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.spec.ts"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:12cc1f98201064ca286401d81b406e820b2ef9bc3acbe2b1355761ee481e0e95",
        "ev:1b6a79f4b76cf6100f09484e00c7739c5e4a5fe3d0ca6e57d272c2691bd3ca43"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:25b3719f6b65a4b76939610218c264d1e19ac58e127ca1e42c57647e49e9e948",
      "text": "cancelPreviewForStage aborts the queued controller, deletes the remembered pipeline, and returns the queue deletion result. The mocked pending-pipeline and pending-options fixtures assert that cancellation returns true, the request rejects with AbortError, and dataService.aggregate is never called after the pending input resolves. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.ts",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.spec.ts"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4db4373dd9e9be59fa7cade05484d7c824223b0d5caa586e52bdd890bca51396",
        "ev:8452a1b506fce9667fd1906977dd4ec5eca14a80da46ba07d2e08ad75e30ac1b"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:13ee7df93b79c107b165623fb12a795850d4d97f3554569e642d52c0fea7daed",
      "text": "clearQueue aborts and removes queued requests at or above its starting index and deletes their remembered pipelines. Its pending-parsing fixture calls clearQueue before resolving the pipeline and asserts that dataService.aggregate is never called. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.ts",
      "also": [
