      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:e3be21b69890a2c40f4f4ef47bc4c7f2b1427c5d607348e2e47aea0a3d870e98",
      "text": "After input resolution, the manager waits with cancellableWait unless force is true. It records the pipeline and calls aggregatePipeline afterward, passing the same controller signal. The helper implements cancellableWait using raceWithAbort around a timeout promise. Thus force skips the debounce branch but does not remove the earlier input-resolution abort race. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.ts",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-utils/src/cancellable-promise.ts"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:12cc1f98201064ca286401d81b406e820b2ef9bc3acbe2b1355761ee481e0e95",
        "ev:1b6a79f4b76cf6100f09484e00c7739c5e4a5fe3d0ca6e57d272c2691bd3ca43",
        "ev:7d48cc38628c40e00a01637553a0492a12bef437fb21afe91bdc162a0f73a304"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:7f038915d9fcb6c2aa29a44e1a55ef2912b6a71e12dd8dd54a951d0e8a349ec5",
      "text": "For this preview path, raceWithAbort rejects an already-aborted signal or races the supplied promise against an abort-listener rejection, then removes the listener in finally. It does not pass a cancellation callback to getPipeline or getPreviewOptions; rejecting the preview wait is not evidence that the underlying parser promises stop executing. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-aggregations/src/modules/pipeline-builder/pipeline-preview-manager.ts",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb-js/compass/1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69/packages/compass-utils/src/cancellable-promise.ts"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:12cc1f98201064ca286401d81b406e820b2ef9bc3acbe2b1355761ee481e0e95",
        "ev:1b6a79f4b76cf6100f09484e00c7739c5e4a5fe3d0ca6e57d272c2691bd3ca43"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "1292483d33fe97513c41e0e67020e4438deb3f69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:0d7c75fc7a22163f6789d86c426d4683466a2a4e3847f72d296288ed59e1cae2",
      "text": "The cited cancellation and supersession fixtures use mockDataService and assert promise outcomes, aggregate call counts, and remembered-pipeline equality. These are source assertions read for this research, not tests executed here; those assertions do not establish termination of an operation on a live MongoDB server. (low confidence)",
